lease_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:fecab2f5c13e44811e24234a3aea66e2eec98f697a360b2969fe476646fc133c","file":"preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/main.tex","line":119,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"594408d8763906ccd305a8361b2e9242358a200289c97f1befdbc165383d9b91","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/main.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:fecab2f5c13e44811e24234a3aea66e2eec98f697a360b2969fe476646fc133c","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Full-support-of-the-zero-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-order-parameter-September-27-2026/build/main.tex#L119"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:full-support}\nIf $\\gamma\\in\\mathcal U$ minimizes $\\mathcal P$, then\n\\[\n \\supp\\mu_\\gamma=[0,1).\n\\]\nIn particular $\\gamma(b)>\\gamma(a)$ whenever $0\\leq a<b<1$.\nFor the solution of~\\eqref{eq:model-diffusion},\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main-consistency}\n \\E[u_\\gamma(t,X_t)^2]=t,\\qquad\n \\E[\\Phi_{\\gamma,xx}(t,X_t)^2]=1,\n \\qquad 0\\leq t<1.\n\\end{equation}"}
